      "id": "claim_dd16f90a811b45b5a4ca449f5fcca764",
      "statement": "Release-please assigns a bump-worthy commit to components by changed file paths rather than Conventional Commit scope; an empty commit therefore has no component path and can fan out to release PRs for every managed package, which the release workflow blocks before release-please runs.",
